  * OPUS OpenSubtitles 2018 (http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles.php), whose data
    originates from OpenSubtitles.org (http://www.opensubtitles.org/) — see the
    OpenSubtitles section below.
  * Google Books Ngram Viewer data. Acknowledgement requested by Google:
    source Google Books Ngram Viewer, http://books.google.com/ngrams
  * Wikipedia (http://www.wikipedia.org), the Leeds Internet Corpus
    (University of Leeds Centre for Translation Studies) and ParaCrawl
    (https://paracrawl.eu), under Creative Commons licences.

