Word frequencies — FrequencyWords / OpenSubtitles
================================================================================
langpack-en-opensubtitles.zip (25k) and langpack-en-opensubtitles-50k.zip are
built from the English lists of FrequencyWords (2018 release):

  FrequencyWords — Hermit Dave
  https://github.com/hermitdave/FrequencyWords
  License: "MIT License for code. CC-by-sa-4.0 for content." The word lists
