================================================================================
Static context language model — Leipzig Corpora Collection
================================================================================
The bundled context models (src/main/assets/lm/<lang>.cklm, built by
scripts/build_static_lm.py) are derived from word-pair counts over these
Leipzig Corpora Collection downloads (web text):

  English  (lm/en.cklm)  eng-com_web-public_2018_300K
  German   (lm/de.cklm)  deu-de_web_2021_300K
  French   (lm/fr.cklm)  fra-fr_web_2013_300K
  Italian  (lm/it.cklm)  ita-it_web-public_2019_300K

Only pruned, quantised word-pair statistics are distributed; no sentence text
is shipped.

  Leipzig Corpora Collection — Universität Leipzig
  https://wortschatz.uni-leipzig.de/en/download
  Terms: https://wortschatz.uni-leipzig.de/en/usage
  License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (CC BY 4.0)

  D. Goldhahn, T. Eckart & U. Quasthoff: Building Large Monolingual
  Dictionaries at the Leipzig Corpora Collection: From 100 to 200 Languages.
  In: Proceedings of the 8th International Language Resources and Evaluation
  Conference (LREC'12), 2012.

CC BY 4.0 is compatible with GPLv3 redistribution; attribution is preserved
here. Source hashes are pinned in scripts/data/PROVENANCE.md.

================================================================================
Static context language model — Tatoeba
================================================================================
The same models additionally count sentences in their language from the
Tatoeba collaborative sentence database, weighted against the Leipzig counts
(English 0.1, German 0.25, French 0.05, Italian 0.1; the per-snapshot weight
and hash are recorded in src/main/assets/lm/<lang>.json).

  Tatoeba — https://tatoeba.org
  License: Creative Commons Attribution 2.0 France (CC BY 2.0 FR)
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0/fr/

The contributors whose sentences were counted are listed, per language, in
files generated with each model:

  scripts/data/tatoeba-contributors-en.txt
  scripts/data/tatoeba-contributors-de.txt
  scripts/data/tatoeba-contributors-fr.txt
  scripts/data/tatoeba-contributors-it.txt
